    "## Section 3: Factor Fingerprints & Stimulus Similarity\n",
    "\n",
    "Each stimulus is represented as the concatenation of `img_factors[s, :]` across all tree\n",
    "nodes (BFS order, all K factors per node). Pairwise cosine similarity reveals how well\n",
    "the factor decomposition separates digit classes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "fingerprint-matrix",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fingerprint matrix: (1000, 139)   (Σ K_i = 139)\n"
